    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 12,
        "line": 6,
        "text": "Come on, Hayes! PUSH IT!... Let me tell ya something, the pain of losing is worse than any pain you’re feeling right now! Okay? Let me tell ya- Shit fire! We are cookin now, boys! We ain’t stoppin until someone pukes! Aite?"
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 569,
        "text": "I’ll be home tomorrow and I’ll explain everything. Just don’t worry. I promise I’m safe and I promise what I’m doing is important... I’ve been thinking a lot and I hope we can start talking more."
      }
    },
